# ===== Env / secrets =====
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Backups of a real .env carry live secrets (JWT, DB, SMTP, PHI key).
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
# Any populated env file, whatever the suffix (.env.production, .env.staging…).
# The bare ".env" rule above does not cover these, and they hold live secrets.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials*.json

